.TH SOMRANDOMIZER 1 "2026-11-11" "Secret of Mana Randomizer" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
somrandomizer, somrandomizer-cli \- randomizer for the SNES game Secret of Mana
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B somrandomizer
.RI [ options ]
.br
.B somrandomizer-cli
.I srcRom=FILE dstRom=FILE seed=SEED options=OPTIONS
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B somrandomizer
starts the graphical randomizer.  It reads a 2 MiB Secret of Mana ROM (a
512-byte copier header is also accepted) and writes a randomized 4 MiB ROM.
.PP
.B somrandomizer-cli
performs the same generation without a display.  Arguments are passed as
.I key=value
pairs; the option string can contain several settings separated by spaces.
.SH OPTIONS
The graphical application has no command-line options.
.PP
The command-line generator requires:
.TP
.B srcRom=FILE
Path to the original Secret of Mana ROM.
.TP
.B dstRom=FILE
Path of the generated ROM.  An existing file is overwritten.
.TP
.B seed=SEED
Seed controlling the randomization.
.TP
.B options=OPTIONS
Randomizer settings, for example
.RB \(dq version=1.49 mode=open \(dq.
The mode can be
.BR rando ,
.BR open ,
.BR ancientcave ,
.BR bossrush ,
or
.BR chaos .
.SH FILES
.TP
.I @PREFIX@/lib/somrandomizer/app
Self-contained graphical application.
.TP
.I @PREFIX@/lib/somrandomizer/cli
Self-contained command-line generator.
.TP
.I @PREFIX@/share/applications/somrandomizer.desktop
Desktop menu entry.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B DISPLAY
X11 display used by the graphical application.  Avalonia 11.3 has no native
Wayland backend; under Wayland this must point at an XWayland display, normally
started by the compositor.
.SH NOTES
The graphical application requires the X11 client libraries.  On a Wayland
session, install and enable XWayland if
.B DISPLAY
is not available.
.SH SEE ALSO
The project README and the upstream Secret of Mana Randomizer documentation.
